WEBVTT

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.239
The Mama Simba program.

00:11:00.572 --> 00:11:04.159
So Munteli said
that as part of their work

00:11:04.201 --> 00:11:07.579
providing lion locations
and forming a home network,

00:11:07.621 --> 00:11:09.998
that all the women, including herself,

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.251
need to be taught to read and write.

00:11:12.292 --> 00:11:15.212
And so they were attending
class once a week.

00:11:15.254 --> 00:11:17.047
And then Munteli came back and said,

00:11:17.089 --> 00:11:20.300
"Actually, you know,
we have far overtaken the men.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.721
So we have built
an enclosure in our village.

00:11:23.762 --> 00:11:26.265
Bring your teacher and bring
your whiteboard.

00:11:26.306 --> 00:11:28.809
We want lessons four times a week."

00:11:29.393 --> 00:11:31.520
And so the women were learning.